UUID=xxxx-xxxx  /var/lib/pgsql/16/data  xfs  rw,noatime,nodiratime,nobarrier,allocsize=16m,inode64  0  0

Option		 Meaning
noatime		 Do not update file access time on reads
nodiratime 	 Do not update directory access time on reads
defaults 	 rw,suid,dev,exec,auto,nouser,async
inode64          Allow inodes > 32‑bit (recommended for XFS)
allocsize=16m    Preallocate large extents (helps sequential WAL/data)

Apply without shutdown DB
mount -o remount,noatime,nodiratime /var/lib/pgsql/16/data

Confirm by 
findmnt -o OPTIONS /var/lib/pgsql/16/data
mount | grep -E 'pg_tblspc_.*noatime'


